  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "If you group up nodes in graphs it will noticeably reduce the response time of the graph.\nQuickest way to reproduce: open up the Udon Graph \"Projectile\" (included in the SDK) and try adding a new variable. Note how long it takes for the variable to show up. Now select all the nodes in the graph and Remove from Group, then try adding a new variable again. It'll be noticeably faster. This can additionally be tested in the UdonSyncPlayer graph for a more extreme example of how much groups can slow things done.\nTested on SDK3 2021.02.23.11.40",
